{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18380","headline":"御沟新柳 · 贾棱","name":"御沟新柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御苑阳和早，章沟柳色新。\n托根偏近日，布叶乍迎春。\n秀质方含翠，清阴欲庇人。\n轻云度斜景，多露滴行尘。\n褭褭堪离赠，依依独望频。\n王孙如可赏，攀折在芳辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾棱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}